      "action": "SCMP_ACT_ALLOW",
      "comment": "Allow syscalls needed by Python, uvicorn, Redis client, bwrap, and general operations. Based on Docker default profile with additions for bwrap (clone, unshare, mount, pivot_root, setns, chroot)."
    },
    {
      "names": ["arch_prctl"],
      "action": "SCMP_ACT_ALLOW",
      "comment": "Allow arch_prctl for x86_64 thread setup"
    },
    {
      "names": ["personality"],
      "action": "SCMP_ACT_ALLOW",
      "args": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "value": 0,
          "op": "SCMP_CMP_EQ"
        }
      ],
      "comment": "Allow personality(0) only — read current personality"
    },
    {
      "names": ["personality"],
      "action": "SCMP_ACT_ALLOW",
      "args": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "value": 8,
          "op": "SCMP_CMP_EQ"
        }
      ],
      "comment": "Allow personality(ADDR_NO_RANDOMIZE) for compatibility"
    },
    {
      "names": ["personality"],
      "action": "SCMP_ACT_ALLOW",
      "args": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "value": 131072,
          "op": "SCMP_CMP_EQ"
        }
      ],
      "comment": "Allow personality(UNAME26) for compatibility"
    },
    {
      "names": ["personality"],
      "action": "SCMP_ACT_ALLOW",
      "args": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "value": 4294967295,
          "op": "SCMP_CMP_EQ"
        }
      ],
      "comment": "Allow personality(0xffffffff) — query current personality"
    }
  ],
  "_comment": "Container-level seccomp profile for Ag3ntum API. Default-deny with allowlist. Allows bwrap syscalls (clone, unshare, mount, pivot_root, setns, chroot) and privilege management (setuid, setgid, chown) needed for sandbox operation. Blocks: ptrace, kexec_load, reboot, swapon/swapoff, init_module, delete_module, acct, and other dangerous syscalls."
}
